# PositionedUp - Complete App Reference

> This file documents every feature, pattern, decision, and gotcha in the PositionedUp codebase.
> Use it to understand the full system before making UI/UX or architectural changes.

---

## 1. WHAT THIS APP IS

PositionedUp is a personal branding and content automation platform. Users:
1. Build a "brand brain" through guided AI coaching (8 modules)
2. Organize knowledge (reference library) and inspiration (Pinterest-style boards)
3. Generate platform-specific content (YouTube scripts, LinkedIn posts, etc.) via an 8-node AI pipeline
4. Track performance and the AI learns from results over time

The system remembers, learns, and improves with every interaction through 6 cognitive layers.

**Product Name:** PositionedUp
**Live Frontend:** https://web-tau-dun-23.vercel.app
**Live Backend:** https://api-iota-puce.vercel.app
**Supabase Project:** `uswwbfmnfgxgfthvbrqt`

---

## 2. TECH STACK

| Layer | Technology | Location |
|-------|-----------|----------|
| Frontend | Next.js 15.5.12, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript | `apps/web/` |
| Backend API | FastAPI, Python 3.9 | `apps/api/app/` |
| Content Pipeline | LangGraph (8-node state machine) | `apps/api/worker/graph/` |
| Database | Supabase Postgres + pgvector + RLS | `infra/supabase/migrations/` |
| Auth | Supabase Auth (JWT, email/password) | `apps/api/app/auth.py` |
| LLM | OpenAI GPT-4o (creative), GPT-4o-mini (review/analysis) | via `openai` SDK |
| Search | DuckDuckGo (`ddgs`) + optional Tavily | `apps/api/app/services/web_search.py` |
| Transcription | YouTube captions + OpenAI Whisper fallback | `apps/api/app/services/ingestion.py` |
| OCR | GPT-4 Vision (scanned PDFs, images) | `apps/api/app/routers/brand.py` |
| Analytics | PostHog (optional) | `apps/web/src/lib/posthog.ts` |
| Testing | Pytest (backend), Playwright (E2E) | `apps/api/tests/`, `apps/web/tests/` |
| Deployment | Vercel (frontend + backend serverless) | `apps/web/vercel.json`, `apps/api/vercel.json` |

### LLM Model Routing & Costs

The app uses smart model routing. Current configuration in `apps/api/worker/graph/llm.py`:

| Context | Model | Input Cost/1K | Output Cost/1K |
|---------|-------|--------------|----------------|
| Pipeline: Signal Research | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Pipeline: Gap Analysis | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Pipeline: Topic Selection | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Pipeline: Hook Lab | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Pipeline: Script Generation | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Pipeline: Editor | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |
| Pipeline: Testing | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |
| Pipeline: Approval | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |
| Brand Chat (all modules) | GPT-4o (default) | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Content Chat (manual mode) | GPT-4o (default) | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| OCR (image text extraction) | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Voice DNA Analysis | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Performance Analytics | GPT-4o | $0.0025 | $0.01 |
| Agent Memory Synthesis | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |
| Voice Drift Detection | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |
| Advisor Suggestions | GPT-4o-mini | $0.00015 | $0.0006 |

**Cost Governance (3 layers):**
1. `max_tokens_per_step` (default 32K) - clamps single LLM calls
2. `max_tokens_per_workflow` (default 200K) - cumulative workflow tokens
3. `max_tokens_per_user_per_day` (default 500K, ~$5/day ceiling) - cumulative daily user tokens

