## 6. DATABASE SCHEMA

All tables in Supabase Postgres with Row Level Security (RLS). 17 migrations in `infra/supabase/migrations/`.

### Core Tables

| Table | Purpose | Key Columns |
|-------|---------|------------|
| `profiles` | User profiles (PK is `user_id`, NOT `id`) | `user_id`, `profile_json` |
| `personal_brands` | Brand profiles per user | `id`, `user_id`, `name`, `profile_json`, `is_active` (NOT `is_default`) |
| `resources` | Knowledge items | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `title`, `body`, `resource_type`, `section`, `tags`, `is_gold`, `source_url` |
| `resource_chunks` | Embeddings for semantic search | `id`, `resource_id`, `chunk_text`, `embedding` (vector 1536) |
| `collections` | Resource groupings | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `name` |
| `inspo_boards` | Inspiration boards | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `name` |
| `inspo_items` | Board items | `id`, `board_id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `title`, `content`, `source_tag`, `intent_note`, `is_starred` |
| `brand_chats` | Chat history | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `module`, `messages` (jsonb), `title`, `extracted` (jsonb) |
| `workflows` | Content pipelines | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `status`, `current_step`, `settings` (jsonb), `error_message`, `claimed_at` |
| `workflow_snapshots` | Pipeline step snapshots | `id`, `workflow_id`, `step_id`, `snapshot_data` (jsonb) |
| `content_assets` | Generated content | `id`, `workflow_id`, `type` (NOT `asset_type`), `content_json` (NOT `body`), `version`, `is_latest`, `status`, `feedback` |
| `content_posts` | Performance tracking | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `title`, `platform`, `views`, `likes`, `comments`, `shares`, `engagement_rate`, `performance_tier` |
| `agent_memory` | AI memories | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `memory_type`, `content`, `embedding` (vector 1536) |
| `agent_experiments` | A/B tests | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `hypothesis`, `status`, `variant_a`, `variant_b`, `results` |
| `scheduled_items` | Calendar items | `id`, `user_id`, `brand_id`, `scheduled_at` (NOT `scheduled_date`) |
| `usage_costs` | Token/cost tracking | `id`, `workflow_id`, `user_id`, `step_id`, `model_name`, `input_tokens`, `output_tokens`, `estimated_cost` |
| `audit_events` | Audit trail | `id`, `user_id`, `event_type`, `payload` |

### CRITICAL Schema Gotchas

- `profiles` PK is `user_id`, NOT `id`. No `email` or `current_brand_id` columns.
- `personal_brands` uses `is_active`, NOT `is_default`. Supabase silently returns empty for non-existent filter columns.
- `content_assets` uses `type` and `content_json`, NOT `asset_type` and `body`. No `title` column.
- `scheduled_items` uses `scheduled_at`, NOT `scheduled_date`.
- `agent_experiments` uses `variable` and `winner`, NOT `experiment_type` and `winner_variant`.
- `brand_chats.module` CHECK constraint allows: foundation, ica, offer, brand, authority, messaging, positioning, competitors, content.

