## 7. API ENDPOINTS

### Backend Routers

| Router File | Prefix | Key Endpoints |
|-------------|--------|---------------|
| `brand.py` | `/brand` | `GET /brand` (profile), `POST /brand/chat` (send message), `GET /brand/chats/{module}` (list chats), `POST /brand/chat/{module}/new` (new chat), `POST /brand/chat/{module}/complete` (extract data), `POST /brand/suggest` (field suggestion) |
| `brands.py` | `/brands` | CRUD for personal brands + section updates |
| `resources.py` | `/resources` | CRUD + file ingestion, `POST /resources/channel` (YouTube import), `POST /resources/re-extract` (retry transcripts) |
| `collections.py` | `/collections` | Collection CRUD |
| `inspo.py` | `/inspo` | Board + item CRUD, URL extraction |
| `content_chat.py` | `/content-chat` | `POST /content-chat/message` (send), `GET /content-chat/chats` (list), `GET /content-chat/chats/{id}` (detail) |
| `workflows.py` | `/workflows` | `POST /workflows` (create), `GET /workflows/{id}` (status), `POST /workflows/{id}/execute` (inline pipeline), `POST /workflows/{id}/topics` (select topic), `POST /workflows/{id}/hooks` (select hook), `POST /workflows/{id}/approval` (approve/reject), `GET /workflows/{id}/snapshots`, `GET /workflows/{id}/assets` |
| `research.py` | `/research` | `POST /research/run`, `POST /research/feed` (aggregated), `POST /research/reddit`, `POST /research/youtube`, `POST /research/linkedin`, `POST /research/tiktok` |
| `picker.py` | `/picker` | `GET /picker/search`, `GET /picker/content/{source}/{id}` |
| `performance.py` | `/performance` | Analytics endpoints, voice baseline, drift check |
| `memory.py` | `/memory` | Agent memory CRUD + search |
| `experiments.py` | `/experiments` | A/B test lifecycle |
| `schedule.py` | `/schedule` | Calendar CRUD, `POST /schedule/import/{workflow_id}` |
| `usage.py` | `/usage` | Token/cost summaries |
| `oauth.py` | `/oauth` | Google/Notion OAuth flows + status |

### Authentication

- Supabase Auth with email/password
- JWT tokens: `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
- Backend: `get_current_user` dependency validates JWT
- Frontend: `@supabase/ssr` for cookie-based sessions
- `apiFetch()` in `client.ts` automatically attaches auth headers

### Config

- `.env` at project root (never committed)
- `apps/api/app/config.py` loads via pydantic_settings into `settings` object
- ALWAYS use `settings.openai_api_key`, NEVER `os.environ.get()`

