## 11. DEPLOYMENT

### Vercel Projects

| Project | Type | URL |
|---------|------|-----|
| `web` | Next.js 15.5.12 | https://web-tau-dun-23.vercel.app |
| `api` | Python Serverless (FastAPI) | https://api-iota-puce.vercel.app |

### Environment Variables

**Frontend (Vercel `web`):**
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` = `https://api-iota-puce.vercel.app`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY` (optional)

**Backend (Vercel `api`):**
- `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- `OPENAI_API_KEY`
- `CORS_ORIGINS` = `https://web-tau-dun-23.vercel.app,http://localhost:3000`
- `LOG_LEVEL` = `INFO`
- `TAVILY_API_KEY` (optional, better search quality)
- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` (optional, for Google Docs export)
- `NOTION_CLIENT_ID`, `NOTION_CLIENT_SECRET` (optional, for Notion export)
- `LANGGRAPH_DB_URI` (optional, for persistent pipeline checkpoints)

### Deploy Commands

```bash
cd apps/web && vercel --prod    # Frontend
cd apps/api && vercel --prod    # Backend
```

### Local Development

```bash
# Backend API (terminal 1)
cd apps/api && python3 -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload

# Frontend (terminal 2)
cd apps/web && npm run dev

# Pipeline Worker (terminal 3, optional - only for background pipeline execution)
cd apps/api && python3 -m worker.main

# Tests
cd apps/api && python3 -m pytest tests/ -v
cd apps/web && npx playwright test
```

