## 12. KNOWN GOTCHAS & BUGS FIXED

### Critical Schema Mismatches (caused production bugs)
- `content_assets`: DB has `type` and `content_json`, NOT `asset_type` and `body`
- `scheduled_items`: DB has `scheduled_at`, NOT `scheduled_date`
- `agent_experiments`: DB has `variable` and `winner`
- `profiles`: PK is `user_id`, no `id`/`email`/`current_brand_id`
- `personal_brands`: `is_active`, NOT `is_default`

### Frontend Pitfalls
- NEVER use `usePostHog()` from `posthog-js/react` (crashes). Use `trackEvent` from `@/lib/posthog`
- NEVER use `waitForLoadState("networkidle")` in Playwright tests (infinite timeout with Supabase)
- Stale `.next` cache: `predev` script auto-clears. `build` script clears `.next` AND `node_modules/.cache`
- `marked` npm package required for content canvas markdown rendering

### Backend Pitfalls
- Python 3.9 only (no match/case, no `|` unions)
- `pydantic_settings` does NOT export to `os.environ`. Always use `settings.xyz`
- `youtube-transcript-api` v1.x: instance methods, not class methods
- `PostgresSaver.from_conn_string()` returns a context manager (must enter it)
- DuckDuckGo rate limits - system degrades gracefully
- Legacy brand profiles (flat keys) need mapping in `calculate_completeness()`

### OAuth Exports
- Google Docs and Notion exports require OAuth credentials in `.env`
- Without them, buttons show "Not configured yet" (friendly error)
- Copy to clipboard and Download .md work without any config

